  "text": "Your generic AI-built sites and pages probably look a lot like this. And at this point, we can all spot an AI-built site in about two seconds. And even if the site content would legitimately change our life or our business, we're bouncing before we even got the chance to realize it because the page just feels flat and lifeless. What you build for your business or for your clients deserves undivided attention. So with Scrollcraft, it is easy and free to bring life to your sites and pages. This skill gives depth and movement and finishing touches that make it feel like a skilled human built the page with care. You can instantly see and feel the difference between the first example and this one. So if you want your sites to look as good as the information and offers they actually communicate, then download Scrollcraft for free. Use it with CloudCode or Codex or any other AI agent that you wanna use, and finally stand out from everyone else pushing generic pages into the market. Give your AI an actual eye for good design. The link's below.",
